WEBVTT

00:00:00.275 --> 00:00:04.213
Welcome to the Diplomacy & Information SME orientation.

00:00:04.213 --> 00:00:07.625
Review the paired Diplomacy and Information outputs after the Macro

00:00:07.625 --> 00:00:09.162
dependency clears.

00:00:09.162 --> 00:00:12.562
Treat every queue item as a bounded specialist review.

00:00:12.562 --> 00:00:15.800
Confirm the source record and dependency state, inspect the

00:00:15.800 --> 00:00:19.825
complete worksheet or handoff, use the explicit specialist control

00:00:19.825 --> 00:00:22.413
, and verify the resulting queue state.

00:00:22.413 --> 00:00:24.975
Your decision becomes evidence for White Cell;

00:00:24.975 --> 00:00:27.975
it does not replace White Cell’s operational role.
